Accessor bounds, which must be the real coordinates and not
the scale-1000 integers the mesh carries:
  min [0,-0.5,0]   present
  max [2,0,1.5]    present

The defect this replaced emitted the raw fixed-point value, so
these must NOT appear:
  raw min        ABSENT
  raw max        ABSENT

Controls. Counts and indices are genuine integers and must stay
integers, so the decimal must not have leaked into them:
  count 3        present
  componentType  present
  asset version  present
